From: Adam Hillson <598804+BadAd84@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] glm: repair the test-cuda-host regressions the 0001-0023 ports introduced

The gate for a family patch is `zig build test-cuda-host`, not check-native-cuda-host or
test-lane-api-host: neither of those compiles the GLM family's host tests, so a patch can
be green in them while breaking the pin's own suite. Measured on a clean 9c9bf542
checkout the pin passes test-cuda-host; on pin+0001..0023 it failed 9 binaries with
named failures the pin does not have. This patch repairs the ones attributable to the
landed ports, named by owner:

0001 (registry): add `fake`, the test-only knob override every knob test drives.
0003 (KDA pad): `tileLinears` had lost its `padKdaInputs` call, so the pad never ran;
restore it, and move the TF_GLM_KDA_DUMP hook into `padKdaInputs` where it belongs.
Restore the staged `cuda.memory.download` in the packing path, which the port had
replaced with a raw `cuMemcpyDtoH_v2` (an unstaged read on the default path).
0004 (draft knobs): `windowBytes` dereferenced `e.drafter` before reading the KEEPWIN
knob, so host-test engines with an undefined field segfaulted; read the knob first. Also
initialise `drafter` in the snapshot fixture and in the host tests' Engine literals.
0007 (any row): `snap_grid` was removed while three host adapters still used it:
`glm_image_cache_host.zig` now declares `snap_min_rows`, `glm_pages_host.zig` expects the
slot at the capacity's own end, and `cuda_pages_test.zig` uses the chunk size as its grid.
0014 (router warm): the warm-serve test passed the comptime family as a runtime argument.
0015 (win free): its own test set `config.Config.shared_depth_full`, an unported lever.
0018 (shared drafts): its own test asserted `shared_depth_full` and `shared_copy_width`,
and swept 32/48/64 shared rows - a range the comptime-sized tables cannot serve, so the
assertion now pins the constant. The copy_drafts_cuda_test suite is a pin file, not an
absent one; its failures are not repaired here and are recorded in the ledger.
0022 (glue fuse): restore the `Lanes.prefillStep` shim the extracted step module needs.

Still failing after this patch, recorded in PORT-LEDGER.md: copy_drafts_cuda_test (7),
cuda_lanes_test's knob assertions (4), cuda_kv8_test, cuda_mla_ovn_test, cuda_onepass,
cuda_zero_budget (2), draft_sources_cuda_test, and the snapshot TF_KV_SHARE adapter test.

Gates: applies on pin+0001..0023; check-native-cuda-host green; test-cuda-host must be
diffed against the pin's green baseline, not expected green wholesale.
